description: Prohibit AI or coding agent co-author attribution in all commits and PRs
globs: "**/*"
alwaysApply: true
---

# No Agent Co-Author Policy (Mandatory)

- **NEVER** add any `Co-authored-by:` / `Co-Authored-By:`, `Assisted-by:`, or `Generated-by:` trailer referencing Cursor or any other AI/coding agent to git commits or pull requests.
- **NEVER** append AI-generated attribution footers to commit messages or PR bodies.
- Always keep the commit author and committer as the human contributor's Git identity.
- Enforced by `.githooks/commit-msg` and `.github/workflows/no-agent-coauthor.yml`.
